  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.6: Feature Release\n- NEW: Ekert QKD (E91) protocol implementation with entanglement-based key distribution\n- NEW: Superdense Coding algorithm for 2-classical-bit quantum channel communication\n- NEW: Quantum Error Correction with Shor 9-qubit, Steane 7-qubit, and 5-qubit codes\n- NEW: Drone swarm collision avoidance, dynamic behavior, and MAVLink/Crazyflie export\n- IMPROVED: CircuitBuilder enhanced with additional gate support and optimizations\n- IMPROVED: LocalBackend expanded with improved state management and gate coverage\n- IMPROVED: Machine learning modules (FeatureMap, QuantumKernel, VQC) refined\n- IMPROVED: Topological module refactored with helpers, improved braiding and noise models\n- IMPROVED: Examples significantly refactored with parameters, better structure, and new examples\n- IMPROVED: Code review and audit updates across the codebase\n- FIXED: RateLimiting, Retry, and JobLifecycle reliability improvements\n- FIXED: HHL types and backend abstraction edge cases resolved\n- Status: Production-ready, 1913+ tests passing",
